  "question": {
    "text": "Let for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>.</mo></math>"
  },
